  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_311546_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_1039596_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fminetraps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/minetraps?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix= &style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/311546(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📖 遊戲說明</h2>\n<p>此模組新增了多種陷阱與方塊，包含地雷、捕獸夾、釘刺陷阱、毒地雷、尖刺等！</p>\n<p>運用各式鐵絲網與障礙物，打造專屬防空洞或守護您的基地！</p>\n<p>若您使用 Fabric / Quilt，請使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此版本</a>！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📷 展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MLlk74C.png\" alt=\"物品與方塊\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zSZsVwv.png\" alt=\"防禦牆\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pULsBYr.png\" alt=\"隱藏炸藥\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/twdet20.png\" alt=\"紅石尖刺\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tTI41PC.png\" alt=\"陷坑陷阱\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/StrgrTN.png\" alt=\"毒素液體\"></p>\n<p><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入內容已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f1J4Ojojukkg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1J4Ojojukkg</a> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🗃️ 相依性</h2>\n<h3>必要：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Magma Core</strong> [&ge; MC 1.21.5]\n<ul>\n<li>提供基礎程式碼與功能（例如更新檢查器）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmagma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>支援：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>顯示哪些物品與方塊帶有狀態效果</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjust-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🎮 我的其他模組！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"附加結構\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/